  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduction of GHG Emission in Thai Industries through Promoting Investments of the Production and Usage of Solid Bio-Fuels - Preparatory Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Related (Main) Project ID: 130318 - The project aims to reduce GHG emission in Thai industries and power plants by promoting the use of industrial-grade solid biofuels as energy source. This project is in line with Ministry of Industry&apos;s Green Industry Initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
